Author: CusDeb OS Team
Description: win32u: Scale SM_CXMINIMIZED to the DPI.
 SM_CYMINIMIZED follows the caption height, which is scaled to the DPI,
 while SM_CXMINIMIZED returned the 96 DPI width of the minimized metrics.
 The ReactOS taskbar uses it as the maximum width of a task button, which
 was half as wide as intended at 192 DPI. Scale the width to the system
 DPI.
Last-Modified: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 19:28:12 +0300

--- a/src/dlls/win32u/sysparams.c
+++ b/src/dlls/win32u/sysparams.c
@@ -7190,7 +7190,7 @@
     case SM_CXMINIMIZED:
         mm.cbSize = sizeof(mm);
         NtUserSystemParametersInfo( SPI_GETMINIMIZEDMETRICS, sizeof(mm), &mm, 0 );
-        return mm.iWidth + 6;
+        return map_to_dpi( mm.iWidth, get_system_dpi() ) + 6;
     case SM_CYMINIMIZED:
         ncm.cbSize = sizeof(ncm);
         NtUserSystemParametersInfo( SPI_GETNONCLIENTMETRICS, 0, &ncm, 0 );
